Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gh
Description: native GitHub Actions self-hosted runner desktop monitor
 Runner Monitor is a native C desktop application linked directly to the
 pinned Infiltratr Common library. Linux uses GTK for its native desktop shell.
 GitHub CLI remains the current credential/API boundary while the first-party
 provider core is qualified to replace it.
